Aleph One

W, S  forwards, backwards
Cursor left, right  turn
A, D  side-step
Mouse  look and turn, left button  fire, right button  second fire
Space  fire, Left Shift  second fire
Q, E  look left, right; cursor up, down  look up, down
R, F  next, previous weapon
Tab  action (doors, switches, terminals)
M  map, Left Ctrl  run
F1, F2  smaller, bigger view; F9  a screenshot
Esc  leave the game (Preferences changes the keys)
